      "content": "it doesnt feel like a phase though. it feels final. like i've reached the end of my capacity. i look at the world and i just dont see the point in trying to force something that isn't there anymore. it's like trying to light a candle with no wax. it's just... exhausting to keep pretending there's something underneath the surface.",
